    given-names: "Ovidiu"
version: "0.4.3"
date-released: 2026-09-01
repository-code: "https://github.com/ovidiuboticiu/intra-agent-evidence-recycling"
url: "https://github.com/ovidiuboticiu/intra-agent-evidence-recycling"
abstract: >-
  A preregistered behavioral study of whether repeated memory records derived
  from one external source acquire excess evidential weight in a local LLM
  agent, and whether explicit lineage metadata mitigates that effect.
keywords:
  - LLM agents
  - agent memory
  - evidence recycling
  - provenance
  - lineage metadata
  - reproducibility
